# Expo Public Environment Variables
# The API URL where the Invest-Planner backend (Express API) is hosted.
#
# Development options:
# 1. Automatic Resolution: The mobile app automatically resolves 'localhost' to your computer's LAN IP when running on Expo Go.
# 2. Explicit LAN IP: http://192.168.1.X:3002 (replace with your computer's Wi-Fi IPv4 address)
# 3. Android Emulator: http://10.0.2.2:3002
# 4. Web Browser / iOS Simulator: http://localhost:3002
# 5. Production: https://api.yourinvestplanner.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3002
